  "title": "Bartolina Sisa",
  "summary": "An Aymara leader born at Caracato in what is now La Paz department, Bolivia. She was part of the rebel siege of La Paz that began on 13 March 1781, and the bulk of the Aymara army stayed under her command on 21 May 1781. She was captured by the Spanish and executed in La Paz on 5 September 1782.",
